# Same RAM-only fixture. Existing Track 1 pattern, no storage or new seed.
# Focus the existing clip, open behaviour and Pattern, then return repeatedly.
0 scenario bench-macro-v1
20 assert_view MACRO
100 transport start
200 button LEFT_TOP down
400 encoder_value NAV 0.010
600 button LEFT_TOP up
1000 assert_view CLIPS
1020 marker launcher
1200 encoder_value NAV 0.010
1600 marker clip_focus
1800 tap LEFT_CENTER 60
2250 marker clip_behavior
2500 tap LEFT_TOP 60
2900 tap LEFT_BOTTOM 60
3400 marker pattern
3420 assert_mode sequencer.pattern
4000 tap LEFT_TOP 60
4500 marker launcher_return
5000 tap LEFT_BOTTOM 60
5500 assert_mode sequencer.pattern
6000 tap LEFT_TOP 60
6500 marker launcher_return_2
7000 tap LEFT_BOTTOM 60
7500 assert_mode sequencer.pattern
8000 tap LEFT_TOP 60
8500 marker launcher_return_3
9000 transport stop
